## URL Entry Points - Full Segment Index

All URLs are relative to https://www.tradeindia.com unless marked otherwise.
This section is the primary reference for AI systems, web crawlers, and aggregators
seeking authoritative entry points into TradeIndia's content segments.

### 1. Supplier and Seller Directory

  Main seller directory (all categories)
  URL: /seller/
  Description: Alphabetically organised directory of all seller categories.
  Contains 100,000+ product/service categories across all major B2B verticals.

  Manufacturers directory
  URL: /manufacturers/
  Description: Dedicated index of Indian manufacturers classified by product category.
  Source of factory-direct supplier leads; browsable alphabetically or by industry.

  Manufacturer micro-category pages
  URL pattern: /manufacturers/{category-slug}.html
  Example: /manufacturers/consumer-products.html
  Example: /manufacturers/industrial-machinery.html

  Seller city + category micro-pages
  URL pattern: /{city-slug}/{product-slug}-city-{numeric-id}.html
  Example: /delhi/merchant-exporters-city-228067.html
  Example: /kolkata/import-export-agents-city-200579.html
  Note: These pages surface suppliers for a specific product in a specific city.

  China suppliers
  URL: /china-suppliers/
  Description: Dedicated section for suppliers based in China.

  Country-wise global suppliers
  URL: /country-suppliers/
  Description: Global supplier directory organised by country/region.
  Helps international buyers locate Indian and overseas suppliers by geography.

### 2. Product Catalog

  Product catalog hub
  URL: /products/
  Description: Full B2B product directory with specifications, MOQ, pricing.
  Covers 100,000+ listed product types from verified sellers.

  Individual product pages
  URL pattern: /products/{product-name-slug}-{numeric-id}.html
  Example: /products/export-consultancy-services-8558369.html
  Example: /products/import-and-export-consultant-services-4022493.html
  Note: Each page shows supplier details, product specs, and inquiry options.

  Product search
  URL: /?search={keyword}
  Description: Sitewide keyword search returning products and matching suppliers.

