## Core Products and Services

### Marketplace Platform
B2B directory and marketplace hosting listings of Indian manufacturers,
exporters, suppliers, importers, traders, and service providers.
Buyers can search, shortlist, and contact sellers across 100,000+ product categories.

### Membership Plans
- Free Listing: Basic company and product profile visibility
- Premium Membership: Enhanced listings, priority placement, higher inquiry volume,
  dedicated relationship manager, Google Ads credit
- Super Premium Seller: 15 sponsored keywords, category banners, product showcase,
  multilingual catalogs, custom header catalog, Trade Alerts banner
- Enterprise Plans: Custom packages for large manufacturers and exporters

### TradeKhata
B2B payments and accounts management; invoicing, outstanding tracking, receivables.

### 360° Digital Marketing
SEO-optimized catalog pages, Google Ads (Premier Google Partner, awarded 3 consecutive years),
digital advertising on TradeIndia network, social media and search visibility.

### Trade Promotions and Events
Trade shows, EXIM exhibitions, MSME Defence Expo, virtual buyer outreach.

